            <div xml:id="m-3c9b5cbf-6097-4a3d-a9b8-08ba8e97fdd1">
              <lg xml:id="m-4efc2b6b-bd12-4017-ae70-d9d8f1cfbd7f">
                <l xml:id="m-5161441c-ce70-43d7-9fba-218d8b117940" facs="#m-422052ab-741a-4f3c-84e0-2f430be34e66" label="ambiguous">*</l><l xml:id="m-e5442079-db0f-4503-8447-4a0d67dc35ec" facs="#m-10faad46-10bd-4054-82d0-d47bc2bde857" label="ambiguous">12774</l><l xml:id="m-6f1a4353-cc35-47f3-9e0a-c8939b37504b" facs="#m-5680ed72-c01f-481a-bdae-8e1ed7e0c8c0" label="text-like">Votive Mass of St. Joseph.</l><l xml:id="m-e186837e-ea58-4ee1-8ad9-1f49c8962683" facs="#m-e0b7b185-2017-48ce-979e-110bdb8305cf" label="text-like">Votive Mass of St. Joseph.</l><l xml:id="m-59935d36-5fe7-437e-b902-8860739d5212" facs="#m-71eca7dc-63a7-4b8c-9c34-b9faf57eb6dc" label="ambiguous">Intr.</l><l xml:id="m-b3e40df1-9150-440a-a072-cba40b5f945a" facs="#m-ee6ee824-9df6-4ab0-b886-bd4d856a4303" label="ambiguous">7.</l><l xml:id="m-73e3722b-393b-48fa-9c42-6bc18f948513" facs="#m-0519f738-fa6a-4b31-b906-ad95b22bed44" label="ambiguous">H</l><l xml:id="m-309e69d9-59ed-4561-be0e-5b03c0a1f964" facs="#m-8f6c9793-3703-407f-96ba-6ec1c77a17bd" label="lyrics-like">Diú-tor* et pro-té-ctor nóster est Dó-minus: in</l><l xml:id="m-d835e044-7920-46c0-988e-c10389f1b8a1" facs="#m-c01a11af-cd58-46b6-ab59-8ba665a5925a" label="lyrics-like">é-o laetá-bi-tur cor nó- strum, et in nó-mine sán¬</l><l xml:id="m-c22296c9-85e5-4e3c-a8a7-830998d94fe1" facs="#m-7ad36ef2-9126-43ae-8e94-42970a43776d" label="lyrics-like">vimus. P.T. Alle- lú-ia, al-le¬</l><l xml:id="m-8cfb0634-c272-4a74-8af2-9a8e8e13c469" facs="#m-de66e550-a24c-4a16-82f2-98f3da92aa9c" label="lyrics-like">cto é¬ jus sperá¬</l><l xml:id="m-0e2472ed-e745-45a0-9cad-fefece63f97d" facs="#m-fa2d14af-8a26-4bfd-b729-7908aed5ed20" label="lyrics-like">lú- ia. Ps. Qui régis Isra-el, inténde: “qui dedú-cis vel¬</l><l xml:id="m-e28efb55-ef56-4250-8386-be146cf024f4" facs="#m-9cfb2cd9-3a3f-4230-bf35-6acc93feff35" label="lyrics-like">ut óvem Jó- seph. Gló- ri-a Pátri. Eu ou a e.</l><l xml:id="m-fb152798-4a2d-4c7d-abdb-9b4d6d7e0000" facs="#m-572c2052-7173-4afe-86c1-fcecd06b2f50" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-2b442d73-83b5-4567-a8c7-be474f01927d" facs="#m-7d815a76-502e-45c1-acc6-dce5d276c55d" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui ineffábili providéntia ut quem protectórem venerámur in</l><l xml:id="m-15586769-3f96-4d02-9d66-e0f6453f97e6" facs="#m-62739783-8787-4604-8ea9-928c290f3c16" label="lyrics-like">I beátum Joseph sanctissimae terris, “ intercessórem habére me¬</l><l xml:id="m-1fdc0485-c005-4352-83fd-04a931068c10" facs="#m-881c20c8-4b35-4c09-bfc3-9fcdb35e1d96" label="lyrics-like">Genitricis tuae sponsum eligere di¬ reámur in caelis: Qui vivis et regnas</l><l xml:id="m-c31c4e19-a512-4567-a5b4-4557c0af869e" facs="#m-065b5eb8-26a6-4a09-936d-218e41ebeef8" label="lyrics-like">gnátus es: t praesta, quaésumus;! cum Deo Patre.</l><l xml:id="m-9ea4e020-71a5-46f9-9772-ac377374c59c" facs="#m-164221ed-f24e-40d0-a354-b9385d9e71cb" label="ambiguous">Lectio libri Genesis. Gen. 49, 22-26.</l><l xml:id="m-27499026-4438-4966-809f-7a8574c68859" facs="#m-7484b5e4-9bb6-4f5b-adc8-c653345b53e5" label="lyrics-like">Lrllius accréscens Joseph, filius jútor tuus, et Omnipotens benedicet</l><l xml:id="m-2a1c21b0-bae8-44c6-b82a-845e1ca0b9f1" facs="#m-346ea2ca-92c1-4405-9208-32961eb16090" label="lyrics-like">accréscens, et decórus aspéctu:</l><l xml:id="m-274544f0-ab58-41c8-91ed-c2c6b1a532cc" facs="#m-b2054498-4be2-4cf8-b511-e6fcd4d91e56" label="lyrics-like">tibi benedictiónibus caéli désuper,</l><l xml:id="m-29cad186-639c-40fb-8dd3-8f0c4cc929df" facs="#m-ab22703e-d013-453b-894a-551ef6a711bd" label="lyrics-like">filiae discurrérunt super murum.</l><l xml:id="m-699bc182-cc47-45ad-9a7c-20591c6a9bee" facs="#m-eca43dbc-02fb-490f-bcdf-f2a8cf7aaf46" label="lyrics-like">benedictiónibus abyssi jacéntis de¬</l><l xml:id="m-060a158c-8e8f-4aa6-8b35-e6f540e392f9" facs="#m-73e0ed67-0c00-4e36-9938-a1425cfaee1d" label="lyrics-like">Sed exasperavérunt eum, et jurgáti</l><l xml:id="m-30070a4e-9400-4ff6-a3f8-260df25ca27f" facs="#m-72970990-9ab8-46e1-b108-bada2b86cbc2" label="lyrics-like">órsum, benedictiónibus úberum et</l><l xml:id="m-e51fd75b-4bd7-4d04-b872-4c6793f8e3a5" facs="#m-bd08dc97-12a3-419a-b652-0aaa5cea48d1" label="lyrics-like">sunt, inviderúntque illi habéntes</l><l xml:id="m-6810fa45-d7a2-42c5-8047-2ea61a5ff818" facs="#m-c2212807-e955-4e6b-a4d8-9998b38f45e7" label="lyrics-like">vulvaé. Benedictiónes patris tui</l><l xml:id="m-6c81fce1-13ef-4b99-91fd-c32ad3e693ab" facs="#m-19f550e1-bdc0-4e0d-b1ad-bb5354d88ef4" label="lyrics-like">confortátae sunt benedictiónibus</l><l xml:id="m-5a58a646-cdc2-488c-a1bf-c8c2fe1d755b" facs="#m-a7e62bcc-dbda-474a-bada-a2068326f589" label="lyrics-like">jácula. Sedit in forti arcus ejus, et</l><l xml:id="m-0135e508-f6d0-4660-80eb-5b336f2d7f1b" facs="#m-0e8b65b1-7a38-4d06-8369-58159f5d27b6" label="lyrics-like">patrum ejus, donec veniret desidé¬</l><l xml:id="m-b4a07b73-7e69-46b0-a983-6eedddf81b94" facs="#m-fdd08876-e58f-4a98-a8a0-f9a1fe7e5804" label="lyrics-like">dissolúta sunt víncula brachiórum,</l><l xml:id="m-a91e4251-21d2-4050-8c47-440162dcfce9" facs="#m-e3646154-120b-4090-bfe3-7219b78f3636" label="lyrics-like">rium cóllium aeternórum: fiant in</l><l xml:id="m-e2bb6d98-5ca3-403f-b07d-6ca4d16e8683" facs="#m-bc11d342-34ad-4083-9dd4-7923695cc797" label="lyrics-like">et mánuum illius per manus potén¬</l><l xml:id="m-77ce58ae-6b2c-49d5-a83e-ad1caa763b64" facs="#m-66525fa5-9c61-4c1e-9da3-e25319e0ef1a" label="lyrics-like">tis Jacob: inde pastor egréssus est,  cápite Joseph, et in vértice Naza¬</l><l xml:id="m-c17e26a2-d7e0-4c72-a6b4-d5571f2971df" facs="#m-41358829-a254-4af2-8b6f-61ce72d125d3" label="lyrics-like">lapis Israël. Deus patris tui erit ad-raéi inter fratres suos.</l><l xml:id="m-d4afdac5-6618-4db6-affa-6a0e3c3df596" facs="#m-cc7b7cf3-e86b-4ed7-9d1c-6b423bf9ae04" label="lyrics-like">Gradual. Dómine, praevenisti, p. 1207.</l><l xml:id="m-219ffa74-264f-4c69-9547-a7b5d14f2507" facs="#m-dbd405b0-d6c2-4571-9691-852ceed9a582" label="lyrics-like">Alleluia, allelúia. V. Fac nos innócuam. p. 1441.</l><l xml:id="m-033efa90-1123-4141-83f4-90e227476d72" facs="#m-c7849b0c-52a4-4ac9-8ce4-37d600ace817" label="lyrics-like">After Septuagesima, the Alleluia and its Verss are omitted; the Tract Beátut</l><l xml:id="m-1b669774-d750-4249-b0b2-4bd75332ceeb" facs="#m-6606c722-b4c6-45b4-960a-732d26e73e40" label="text-like">vir. is said as on p. 1134.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>